# Lets the kit's own commands run outside Codex's sandbox. HyperFrames previews and renders start a headless Chrome and a
# local Studio server, which the macOS sandbox blocks. Only bin/kit is allowed, nothing else. Codex reads this when the
# kit folder is a trusted project.
prefix_rule(pattern=["bin/kit"], decision="allow")
prefix_rule(pattern=["./bin/kit"], decision="allow")
